The v4.1 architecture is explicitly designed to satisfy functional safety requirements for SIL 2 (IEC 61508) and PL d (ISO 13849). Samsung Electronics' recent certification of a Safety Software Framework for Mobile Robots at SIL 2/PL d demonstrates that software-based safety functions can achieve the required integrity levels without dedicated hardware controllers.

